"program_narrative": "RPTAUD00 is a batch audit report generator intended to produce a system audit report from the audit trail file and the error log. It opens the indexed AUDIT-FILE and ERROR-FILE for reading and the sequential REPORT-FILE for output; if any of the three files fails to open it displays an error message and ends with return code 12. It then writes the report heading lines (a line of asterisks, the title 'SYSTEM AUDIT REPORT' and the report date). The report body is organised in three steps - audit trail processing, error log processing and summary writing - but the seven paragraphs that would read the audit and error records and write the audit, error and control summaries are not present in the source, so that part of the logic cannot be traced and is reported as unresolvable. Finally it closes the three files and returns. Error conditions handled: open failure of any of the three files.",
